    ========================================

    LAST SHIFT

    ========================================



    A
    GAME BY

    Joshua Benjamin Rompis

    Fadlan muzacky

    farras zafir imran





    ========================================

    DEVELOPMENT
    & GAME DESIGN

    ========================================



    Lead Programmer
    & Game Designer

    Joshua Benjamin Rompis



    AI-Assisted Development

    AI
    Partner





    ========================================

    GAME TESTING

    ========================================



    Game
    Tester

    Fadlan Muzacky





    ========================================

    VIDEO
    PRODUCTION

    ========================================



    Video Editing

    Fadlan
    Muzacky





    ========================================

    3D DESIGN

    ========================================



    3D
    Design

    Farras Zafir Imran





    ========================================

    3D
    ASSETS & MODELS

    ========================================



    "Office
    PSX Asset Pack"

    by Alex

    @arexmotion / Apfelgarten



    "Surveillance
    Camera"

    by AK Studio Art

    Unity Asset Store



    "LowPoly Asset Pack
    Free"

    CC0 Public Domain



    "Starter Assets - First Person Controller"

    by
    Unity Technologies





    ========================================

    AUDIO
    & SOUND EFFECTS

    ========================================



    "Door Open
    01"

    by anthousai

    Freesound.org



    Notification SFX

    Inspired
    by Fears to Fathom



    "Ambient Hallway & Concrete Footstep

    SFX Collection"



    "Jumpscare
    SFX Collection"





    ========================================

    SHADERS
    & VISUAL EFFECTS

    ========================================



    "URP Retro
    CRT Shader"

    by Cyanilux

    MIT License



    "Day-Night Skyboxes"

    by
    Pulsar Bytes



    "Massive Crosshair Bundle"

    by OccaSoftware





    ========================================

    FONTS

    ========================================



    "Home
    Video Font"

    by Save The Fonts / Tepache Labs



    "SF Compact Rounded"

    by
    FontsFree



    TextMesh Pro

    by Unity Technologies





    ========================================

    COMPETITION

    ========================================



    Developed
    as an entry for



    Indie Game Ignite

    COMPFEST

    Universitas Indonesia





    ========================================

    SPECIAL
    THANKS

    ========================================



    Thank you for playing
    LAST SHIFT.



    Good luck, and stay until the

    end of your shift.





    ========================================

    LAST
    SHIFT

    ========================================

'
